ul.li:
begin the result URL template with the execution URL followed by
          /, so every result sits under the capability, and scope
          request identifiers, retries and results to the capability;

send Referrer-Policy: no-referrer from pages that carry
          the capability, and keep the capability out of the human route and
          out of its logs;

read the capability from the path exactly as written, never
          decoded or normalized, and use no dot segments in capability
          URLs;
